// spec: `enum class` is no kpp (every kpp enum is scoped, design.md 8.4, kovarex 2026-11-18), [[c]] or not: the error names what to write
// error: c_enum_attribute_on_enum_class_is_error.kpp:3: error: kpp's enums are all scoped: write `enum Name`, not `enum class Name`
[[c]] enum class Mode { Read, Write };
int main()
{
  return 0;
}
